From 8d3eff9abba3f224c6d701cb8d88d4b482871a19 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:58:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): default model tier for unpinned cards
 (kanban.default_model) [daveey]

When kanban.default_model is set the dispatcher runs a card with no pinned
model on it (in-memory pin, card row unchanged). Cards keep the profile model
when pinned, in the review lane, retried after a failed run/changes_requested,
matching kanban.default_model_keep_patterns, or assigned outside
kanban.default_model_profiles. Each decision is a model_tier task event.
Empty default_model = upstream behaviour.
---
